    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm pretty sure i got a tetanus shot when i was in high school, so i should be fine right? it's just a little hole in my foot, it's not like my arm or something. if i just use a lot of antiseptic and keep it covered with a thick bandage, surely it'll just heal up on its own? i just really dont want to deal with the hospital if i can avoid it.",
